<title>FINLAND: RUOKATALO SAYS Q1 SALES UP 13 PCT.</title>
<headline>RUOKATALO SAYS Q1 SALES UP 13 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK-Ruokatalo Oy said in a statement on Friday its January-March net sales increased 13 percent year-on-year to 605 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The earnings trend was slightly better than forecast and the operating margin increased 2.6 percentage points,&quot; HK-Ruokatalo said.</p>
</text>
